<section class="section home-faq" id="faq"><div class="section-kicker">FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS <span>ANSWERS FOR OPERATIONS TEAMS</span></div><div class="faq-grid"><h2>Good questions.<br><em>Clear answers.</em></h2><div class="faq-list"><details><summary>What is ProcessArc?</summary><p>A structured workspace to catalog business processes, map workflows, analyze performance and manage improvements.</p></details><details><summary>Do I need AI to use it?</summary><p>No. Core registry, workflows, metrics and improvement tracking work without an AI integration.</p></details><details><summary>Where is my data stored?</summary><p>Storage depends on the deployment environment. The local starter uses SQL, and the demo uses fictional sample information. Do not upload sensitive records to public demo tools.</p></details><details><summary>Can I use my own model?</summary><p>An optional local Ollama endpoint can run a Qwen model. NVIDIA NIM is a separate proposed option and requires configuration.</p></details><details><summary>How is AI governed?</summary><p>AI outputs are suggestions only. People review them, and ProcessArc does not autonomously approve or change processes.</p></details></div></div></section>

